<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-096-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.431806" lon="-120.996107"><name>SC26-096-B</name><cmt>SC26-096</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 8.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 69/100; not catch probability. Center 149 ft; nearby 148–172 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-076</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.435005875323675" lon="-120.99608282812535"/><trkpt lat="35.43467466013862" lon="-120.9978534473998"/><trkpt lat="35.4336170412145" lon="-120.99931157779353"/><trkpt lat="35.4332584148889" lon="-120.99943060088516"/><trkpt lat="35.43297895072105" lon="-120.99888677420755"/><trkpt lat="35.432708612306214" lon="-120.99889346513453"/><trkpt lat="35.432714087958175" lon="-120.99922377351577"/><trkpt lat="35.432443749475745" lon="-120.99923046325104"/><trkpt lat="35.43243644847832" lon="-120.99879005356598"/><trkpt lat="35.43270678688827" lon="-120.99878336236057"/><trkpt lat="35.43269948421337" lon="-120.9983429513638"/><trkpt lat="35.43251925865655" lon="-120.99834741315739"/><trkpt lat="35.43251378063337" lon="-120.99801710574886"/><trkpt lat="35.43224344234151" lon="-120.9980237994676"/><trkpt lat="35.43224892